# Density Compare
# Strontium (Sr) — real density 2.64 g/cm³. equal masses: Strontium vs water — sides ∝ (1/ρ)^(1/3).
scene "Strontium Density Compare"

element_cube = cube 14.5mm color: #00ff00 at (-20mm, 7.2mm, 0)
water_cube = cube 20mm material: water at (18mm, 10mm, 0)
# both cubes weigh the same: about 21.1 g — the water cube is the reference
